minios-help (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of the native GTK 3 MiniOS documentation viewer.
  * Bundle deterministic offline documentation generated from MiniOS docs.
  * Add local search, language fallback, history, anchors and responsive sidebar.
  * Keep search and language controls usable at the 420 px compact window
    minimum without forcing the HeaderBar wider than the window.
  * Render Markdown and optional Mermaid flowcharts through minios-gui.

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 01:20:00 +0300
